 rosé) made from our very own 2024 Sonoma County Rosé https://adoberoadwin
 es.com/product/2024-rose-sonoma-county . It's available by the glass on F
 riday and Saturday\, while supplies last. We hope you love it!\n\nEven be
 tter\, Inside Track Wine Club https://adoberoadwines.com/wine-club/ membe
 rs enjoy additional club member pricing as well.\n\nOur frosé is availabl
 e on Fridays and Saturdays\, while supplies last. Walk-ins welcome\, rese
