SUMMARY: Theatre District Summer Concert Series – Josh Yenne
DESCRIPTION:Theatre District is thrilled to announce the return of its Su
 mmer Concert Series for 2026. Beginning in June and running through Septe
 mber\, the series features free live music every Friday from 6:00 PM to 8
 :00 PM in downtown Petaluma. The concert series brings together local tal
 ent and diverse musical styles\, creating a vibrant community gathering i
 n the heart of the Theatre District.\n\nJosh Yenne https://joshyenne.com/
  is performing from 6:00 to 8:00 in Theatre Square. We hope to see you th
 ere!\n\nJosh Yenne is a versatile musician based in Petaluma\, California
 \, known for his expertise on the pedal steel guitar\, guitar\, and bass.
  With a career that spans various genres\, including country\, rock\, blu
 es\, jazz\, and bluegrass\, Yenne has performed on stages around the worl
 d\, from the Sydney Opera House to intimate house concerts in Petaluma. H
 is solo acoustic shows often feature original songs that delve into histo
 rical American themes\, blending elements of folk\, ragtime\, and America
 na.
CATEGORIES:Summer-Concert-Series,Theatre-District,Music,Live-Music
