SUMMARY: Petaluma Woman's Club Blood Drive
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Petaluma Woman's Club for a community blood dr
 ive. Blood donations are essential for patients undergoing surgery\, canc
 er treatment\, trauma care\, and other medical needs.\n\nDonate and Make 
 a Difference\n\nAll eligible donors are encouraged to participate. The do
 nation process is safe\, simple\, and typically takes about an hour from 
 registration to refreshments.\n\nTo make an appointment\, visit http://ww
 w.vitalant.org and use code PWC. You can also scan the QR Code\n\n\nQuest
 ions or appointment assistance? Contact Vitalant at 877-258-4825.\n\nThan
 k you for helping provide a lifesaving gift to our community
