SUMMARY: Speaker Series: Conversation with Women Leaders in our Community
DESCRIPTION:Dr. Laura Kimbro is a retired OB/GYN physician\, women’s heal
 th educator\, and speaker with a passion for helping women navigate the p
 erimenopause and menopause transition with knowledge\, vitality and confi
 dence.\n\n\nHer lectures invite women to better understand the profound t
 ransition of midlife\, not simply as a medical event but as a meaningful 
 new chapter.\n\n\nLECTURE 1\n(The first in a series of three lectures)\nP
 erimenopause and Menopause: “What’s Happening to My Body?\n\n﻿The first t
 alk focuses on helping women understand the re-calibration that occurs du
 ring this transition and how the hormonal shifts affect the entire body.\
 n\nIt includes why symptoms such as sleep disruption\, mood changes\, bra
 in fog\, and weight shifts occur\, and why many women feel dismissed or m
 isunderstood during this transition.\n\nThe goal is to replace confusion 
 with clarity and help women recognize that these changes are both real an
 d manageable.\n\nRSVP by June 20th\n\nAttendance is free\; donations at t
 he door are welcome!
CATEGORIES:petalumawomansclub,womenshealth,menopause,petaluma
