SUMMARY: The Vacancy Project: From Empty Spaces to Vibrant Places
DESCRIPTION:Petaluma Urban Chat has launched The Vacancy Project\, a bold
  new effort to tackle long-standing empty storefronts and underused lots 
 in the heart of the city. At the center is an interactive\, community-bui
 lt Vacancy Map highlighting over 40 vacant properties within a half-mile 
 of downtown—bringing visibility to an issue that’s been hiding in plain s
 ight.\n\nThese spaces represent more than empty buildings. They mean lost
  opportunities for housing\, local businesses\, and a thriving downtown.\
 n\nNow it’s time to take the next step.\n\n  * RSVP https://www.tickettai
 lor.com/events/urbanchat/2174223 to join the conversation and help shape 
 the future of downtown Petaluma.\n\nJoin us for a free community organizi
 ng meeting to turn insight into action. We’re bringing together residents
 \, property owners\, and local leaders to identify solutions\, shape prio
 rities\, and begin building a shared roadmap to activate these spaces and
  bring new life to downtown Petaluma.\n\nThe event is free\, and we ask t
 hat you RSVP https://www.tickettailor.com/events/urbanchat/2174223 in adv
 ance to be part of the conversation.\n\n\n
CATEGORIES:Community,Event,Downtown,Revitalize
