SUMMARY: Theatre District Summer Concert Series – King Street Giants
DESCRIPTION:Theatre District is thrilled to announce the return of its Su
 mmer Concert Series for 2026. Beginning in June and running through Septe
 mber\, the series features free live music every Friday from 6:00 PM to 8
 :00 PM in downtown Petaluma. The concert series brings together local tal
 ent and diverse musical styles\, creating a vibrant community gathering i
 n the heart of the Theatre District.\n\nKing Street Giants https://www.th
 ekingstreetgiants.com/ are performing from 6:00 to 8:00 in Theatre Square
 . We hope to see you there!\n\nKing Street Giants is a Bay Area–based Ame
 ricana and folk-rock group known for their rich harmonies\, driving rhyth
 ms\, and high-energy live performances. Blending elements of roots rock\,
  folk\, and country influences\, the band has built a sound that feels bo
 th timeless and fresh\, rooted in storytelling and musicianship. With a f
 ocus on strong songwriting and dynamic arrangements\, the King Street Gia
 nts bring a lively and engaging presence to the stage\, creating performa
 nces that resonate with a wide range of audiences. Their music captures t
 he spirit of classic Americana while delivering a modern edge\, making th
 em a standout in today’s live music scene.
CATEGORIES:Summer-Concert-Series,Theatre-District,Music,Live-Music
