 larships for local high school graduates\, helping students pursue higher
  education and achieve their future goals.\n\n\nEvent Highlights\n• Garde
 n-inspired refreshments and appetizers\n• Silent auction featuring unique
  items and experiences\n• Music and fellowship\n• Support scholarships fo
 r local students\n\n\nWe look forward to celebrating with you and making 
 a difference in the lives of local students.\n\n\nPetaluma Woman's Club F
 oundation
