SUMMARY: Jazz in the Plaza
DESCRIPTION:Free outdoor jazz concerts in Petaluma! Now in its sixth year
 \, you can enjoy Jazz in the Plaza right in downtown Petaluma\, every Sun
 day from 1-3:30. Hosted by local jazz bassist and jazz music book publish
 er Chuck Sher\, he presents a rotating ensemble of professional\, veteran
  jazz musicians in Putnam Plaza Park\, right next to the Speakeasy. Spons
 ored by Music in Place\, this event started in 2020 and has since become 
 a staple for locals and visitors alike. Stop by and enjoy some of the bes
 t jazz the Bay Area has to offer!
