SUMMARY: 11th Annual Ribs for Kids
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we host our 11th annual Ribs for Kids fundraiser o
 n Saturday\, July 11th from 12-4pm at Lucchesi Park!\n\nBring your family
  and friends for a great summer day filled with all-you-can-eat BBQ\, liv
 e music by The Remedies\, local artisans\, and fun for all ages.\n\nTicke
 t Options:\n\n  * GA: Includes entry and all-you-can-eat ribs\, chili & s
 ides\n  * VIP: Includes all GA perks + unlimited drinks & exclusive acces
 s\n  * Discounted options available for vegetarians & kids\n\nAs always\,
  every ticket purchased goes toward our back-to-school shopping spree in 
 August\, ensuring local underserved youth get the essentials they need to
  succeed. Come hungry and leave knowing you’ve made a difference!\n\n
CATEGORIES:Petaluma,Fundraiser,BBQ,Music
