SUMMARY: Bands on The Basin-A Floating Concert for All
DESCRIPTION:Petaluma's iconic floating concert returns! Featuring Foxes i
 n the Henhouse\, Soul Shake and Sebastian Saint James Band\, this day of 
 music and community benefits The Floathouse Petaluma.\n\nWatch the bands 
 from shore at TAPS on the River or LUMA Bar & Eatery\, or\, better yet\, 
 BYO boat and launch from the Petaluma Marina or Weller Street docks.\n\nF
 or easy-peasy access\, rent a boat\, board or water bike https://book.pee
 k.com/s/b76ef819-32fe-4f61-a8f5-8c31cf4edd7d/3yXR1?utm_source=bands_on_th
 e_basin_visit_petaluma&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=BOTB_rentals from Th
 e Floathouse! (Choose from canoes\, kayaks\, pedal craft\, rowboats and p
 addle boards--15 different kinds are available to you.) On event day\, al
 l rentals are 90 minutes or 2 hours. We suggest you rent ASAP\, as empty 
 boat racks are in the forecast.\n\nThis event\, a COVID-era solution for 
 bands and fans alike\, has become a staple of summer in the North Bay\, f
 eaturing live music\, high energy\, great vibes and of course\, celebrati
 on of Petaluma's Longest Park\, the Petaluma River. Join the floating con
 cert!
CATEGORIES:bands-on-the-basin,petaluma-river-concert,floathouse-concert,o
 utdoor-music
