 enco Dinner Show with a Full bar and a Dinner menu \, not included in adm
 ission.\n\nVery Limited Seating Reservations for parties of 6 or more onl
 y at:\n(707) 774-9072\n\n*Large fully ventilated restaurant\, plenty of r
 oom for spacing.\n\nFlamenco Dinner Shows every OTHER Month!\nOn the 2nd 
