 t Artists every Show.\n\nJoin us for an intoxicating evening of fiery\nFl
 amenco performances when FLAMENCO! LIVE!\nbrings the fury and passion of 
 Spain's legendary\nGypsies (Roma) in the intimate atmosphere of THE BIG E
 ASY.\nStirring dances\, blazing guitars\, and soulful singing will\ntrans
 port you to another place and time. FEEL the HEAT...\n
