SUMMARY: Theatre District Summer Concert Series – Spike Sikes and his Awe
 some Hotcakes
DESCRIPTION:Theatre District is thrilled to announce the return of its Su
 mmer Concert Series for 2026. Beginning in June and running through Septe
 mber\, the series features free live music every Friday from 6:00 PM to 8
 :00 PM in downtown Petaluma. The concert series brings together local tal
 ent and diverse musical styles\, creating a vibrant community gathering i
 n the heart of the Theatre District.\n\nSpike Sikes and his Awesome Hotca
 kes https://awesomehotcakes.com/ are performing from 6:00 to 8:00 in Thea
 tre Square. We hope to see you there!\n\nSpike Sikes and his Awesome Hotc
 akes is a Sonoma County-based band renowned for their soulful blend of sw
 ing\, jazz\, R&B\, and blues. Formed in 2014 by vocalist and multi-instru
 mentalist Spike Sikes\, the group delivers a sound that’s both nostalgic 
 and fresh\, reminiscent of classic artists like Ray Charles and Van Morri
 son. Their 2022 album Magnolia Street captures this essence\, offering tr
 acks that are both heartfelt and dance-inducing. Recognized as the “Best 
 Blues Band” in Napa\, Sonoma\, and Marin Counties for three consecutive y
 ears\, they continue to captivate audiences across Northern California wi
 th their infectious energy and timeless tunes.
CATEGORIES:Summer-Concert-Series,Theatre-District,Music,Live-Music
