 0e2d29328c/6a05060c64f49cafacde8863/scaled_1024.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Paddle the Petaluma: Turn to The River is a relaxed\
 , beginner-friendly guided kayak tour exploring the past\, present\, and 
 future of Petaluma’s historic...
X-TKF-PROMOTION-BUTTON;label=learn more;skip_details=false:https://www.th
 efloathousepetaluma.org/turn-to-the-river
LOCATION:The Floathouse Petaluma\,50 Water Street\, Petaluma\, CA 94952\,
  USA
