SUMMARY: Made with Love
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a day of shopping\, wellness\, and community at M
 ade With Love\, a local gift boutique and wellness fair celebrating the p
 eople\, businesses\, and organizations that make Petaluma such a special 
 place to live\, work\, and thrive.\n\nExplore a diverse collection of loc
 al artisans\, makers\, wellness vendors\, food and beverage vendors\, han
 dmade goods\, unique gifts\, wellness products\, and community resources 
 while connecting with friends\, neighbors\, and local business owners.\n\
 nWhether you're searching for one-of-a-kind treasures\, looking for welln
 ess inspiration\, enjoying family-friendly activities\, or simply spendin
 g the day supporting local businesses\, there's something for everyone to
  enjoy.\n\n\nEvent Highlights\n\n  * Local artisans\, makers\, and small 
 businesses\n  * Handmade gifts and specialty goods\n  * Wellness resource
 s\, services\, and products\n  * Wellness classes and demonstrations\n  *
  Food and beverage vendors\n  * Family-friendly activities\n  * Community
  organizations and resources\n  * Prize giveaways throughout the event\n 
  * Free admission\n\n📍 1301 Southpoint Blvd.\, Petaluma\, CA\n\n📅 Satur
 day\, September 26\, 2026\n🕙 10:00 AM – 2:00 PM\n\nCome shop local\, sup
 port small businesses\, discover wellness resources\, enjoy local food an
 d drinks\, and celebrate community—all in one place.\n\n---\nInterested i
 n becoming a vendor?\n\nWe're currently accepting applications from local
  artisans\, makers\, wellness providers\, food and beverage vendors\, and
  small businesses. Vendor booths are free\, and we welcome businesses tha
 t are excited to engage with the community and help promote the event.\n\
 nFor vendor information and applications\, please contact us at marketing
 @petalumadental.com mailto:marketing@petalumadental.com .
CATEGORIES:wellness,community,crafts,handmade-goods
