SUMMARY: Butter & Egg Days Opening Ceremonies
DESCRIPTION:2027 Butter & Egg Days - Opening Ceremonies\n\nDate: Saturday
 \, April 10\, 2027\, Noon to 1 pm\n\nLocation: Petaluma Historical Librar
 y & Museum\, 20 4th St\n\nJoin in the kick off of Petaluma History Week &
  Butter & Egg Days festivities!\n\nJoin City\, Petaluma Museum\, Petaluma
  Downtown Association\, and Petaluma Visitors Program staff to applaud an
 d thank Petaluma’s newest Good Eggs\, cheer for the 2027 Grand Marshal\, 
 and get ready for the 2027 Butter & Egg Days Parade and Festival the next
  weekend on Saturday\, April 17\, 2027! Participants and spectators alike
  will be invited to to celebrate the magic and charm of our historic town
 . The 2027 event theme will be announced in January.\n\nVisit ButterAndEg
 gDays.com http://www.ButterAndEggDays.com for more information!
CATEGORIES:Festival,Local,Butter,Egg,Petaluma,CA,California
